This package implements cmi5, a specification of ADL, the Advanced Distributed Learning Initiative of the United States
Department of Defense, written with the former AICC and published under the Apache License 2.0, over xAPI, the standard IEEE
9274.1.1. It includes no text or file of the specification or of its test suites: the schema, the examples, the requirements
and the packages that its tests read are downloaded at pinned hashes and never committed.

